https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-41459 not a bug as reported (Q1 vs Q2).

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_mariadb813_db0_vp599_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_mariadb813_db0_vp599_min;
USE repro_mariadb813_db0_vp599_min;

SET SESSION optimizer_switch='derived_merge=on';
SET SESSION sort_buffer_size=2097152;
SET SESSION max_sort_length=6259757;

CREATE TABLE s(id INT, c1 BOOLEAN) ENGINE=MyISAM;
CREATE TABLE l(id INT) ENGINE=MyISAM;
CREATE TABLE r(id INT, c1 BOOLEAN) ENGINE=MyISAM;

DROP TEMPORARY TABLE IF EXISTS tmp;
CREATE TEMPORARY TABLE tmp ENGINE=InnoDB AS
SELECT l.id, r.c1
FROM l JOIN r ON l.id=r.id;

-- Q1：原单表查询
SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT DISTINCT REGEXP_REPLACE('1', c1, 'a') AS v
    FROM s
    WHERE c1
) q
ORDER BY 1;

-- Q2：分表重建后的查询
SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT DISTINCT REGEXP_REPLACE('1', c1, 'a') AS v
    FROM tmp
    WHERE c1
) q
ORDER BY 1;

Q1:
Empty set

Q2:
ERROR 1038 (HY001):
Out of sort memory, consider increasing server sort buffer size

实际计划如下，省略全部为 NULL 的索引相关列：
Q1:
id  select_type  table       type    rows  Extra
1   PRIMARY      <derived2>  system  0     Const row not found
2   DERIVED      NULL        NULL    NULL  no matching row in const table

两表 JOIN:
id  select_type  table  type  rows  Extra
1   SIMPLE       NULL   NULL  NULL  Impossible WHERE noticed after reading const tables

Q2:
id  select_type  table       type  rows  Extra
1   PRIMARY      <derived2>  ALL   2     Using temporary; Using filesort
2   DERIVED      tmp         ALL   1     Using where; Using temporary

在相同数据和会话参数下，原查询因优化器识别空表直接返回空集；重写为 InnoDB 临时表后，优化器未识别临时表为空，选择 DISTINCT + filesort 计划，并在零行输入上触发 ERROR 1038 Out of sort memory。调整 max_sort_length 后 Q2 可返回空集，说明逻辑结果一致，但原参数下查询执行失败。不是“结果集错误”，而是“合法查询在合法参数下执行失败，且与等价查询行为不一致”